title: "fidelis-alicelabs: local-first, zero-LLM memory for AI agents (AliceLabs proprietary fork)"
abstract: "AliceLabs proprietary fork of Fidelis Memory. Stores agent-curated records locally and retrieves their original text with stable IDs, correction history, and validity dates. Default MCP recall uses local vector search without a generative LLM. Licensed under the AliceLabs Proprietary License v1.0 — commercial use requires a separate license from AliceLabs."
